{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello(*^^*)\nいつもコメントくださるかた！\n始めてのかた！\n暖かいお言葉、本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←このデコメ面白いでしょ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメント見て、パワーをもらってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までのコメントを呼んだり、\n握手会で、ワイワイ握手したり、\nblog書くのが大好きで、\nいつも、皆様のこと考えてニヤニヤしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※けして変な人では御座いません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は皆に会いたい病で、\n妄想握手会を頭の中でくりひろげております！\n※もう一度言いますが、けして、変な人では御座いません！\nだって早く会いたいもーーーーんだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドカーーーンッ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは今日はですねぇ、あしゅか姫が、自分のこと私のblogに書いてほしいみたいですよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで！\nあしゅか紹介"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書きたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ことの始まりは、こちらです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(メール内容)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『あしゅかだぁいすきよー(^3^)/』\nといきなり送ると、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齋藤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『待ってたよマイハニー！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってきたの！\n私の頭は\n？？？？？ って感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってあしゅかが、ツンツンじゃないもーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから私が、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『今日はツンツンじゃなくてうれしー！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齋藤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『今日はデレる！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとも爆弾発言！\nかわいすぎるだろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『あしゅかからの返信が来ると一人電車のなかでにやけてしまう...。←きもいねっ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齋藤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『変態ぃぃぃぃ(*_*)でれてあげたんだからブログ書きなさいよ！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『あしゅか姫！この私がかいてみせまふよ☆』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てな感じです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかんだいって、\nあしゅかとはめっちゃ仲良しなんよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動中とか楽屋は、\nあしゅかはまあやのことが好きだから、近くに来るのよ！\n一緒にいたいけどツンツンしてるだけよ! 見ててわかるもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ったく可愛いんだから！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁーー！\nいいこと教えてあげる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前、メンバーと温泉に行ったとき、あしゅかねぇ、\n『お風呂のお湯が熱くて入れないー！』\nっていってびびってたぁ！\nあっ！これあしゅかに内緒ね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"果てしなくかわいいぜっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅのことなら私に聞いてくだしゃい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかサイズオーバーで、画像張れんかったぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またのせるー！ごめーーーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度はろってぃの部屋でみた面白いものを紹介シチャウゾッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/2752674/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★質問★\n☆ 広島のイベントいくよっ！ってかた手挙げてー！\n☆行けないけど応援してるよ！ってかた手挙げてー！\nbye"}],"source":"archive"}